      "anchor_id": "AST-2026-691cca#s2.h",
      "kind": "section",
      "text": "诊断依据"
    },
    {
      "anchor_id": "AST-2026-691cca#s2.p1.c1",
      "kind": "sentence",
      "text": "主诉与检查支持 缺铁性贫血（ICD-10 D50.9），就诊科室 血液内科"
    },
    {
      "anchor_id": "AST-2026-691cca#s3.h",
      "kind": "section",
      "text": "检查项目"
    },
    {
      "anchor_id": "AST-2026-691cca#s3.p1.c1",
      "kind": "sentence",
      "text": "血常规、血清铁蛋白、骨髓涂片"
    },
    {
      "anchor_id": "AST-2026-691cca#s4.h",
      "kind": "section",
      "text": "治疗原则"
    },
    {
      "anchor_id": "AST-2026-691cca#s4.p1.c1",
      "kind": "sentence",
      "text": "缺铁性贫血需要做血常规检查以评估贫血程度"
    },
    {
      "anchor_id": "AST-2026-691cca#s5.h",
      "kind": "section",
      "text": "随访要求"
    },
    {
      "anchor_id": "AST-2026-691cca#s5.p1.c1",
      "kind": "sentence",
      "text": "缺铁性贫血可导致乏力，治疗四周后复查血清铁蛋白"
    },
    {
      "anchor_id": "AST-2026-691cca#s6.h",
      "kind": "section",
      "text": "关联依据"
    },
    {
      "anchor_id": "AST-2026-691cca#s6.p1.c1",
      "kind": "sentence",
      "text": "消化性溃疡可导致缺铁性贫血，长期隐性失血是主要原因"
    }
